By Stefanie Bo ster at5:26pm, Apr282023
MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING
BETWEEN MEMORIAL HOSPITAL OF LARAMIE COUNTY D/B/ACHEYENNE
REGIONAL MEDICAL CENTER, CHEYENNE FIRE RESCUE, ANDAMERICAN
MEDICAL RESPONSE
1.Parties. This Memorandum of Understanding (this“MOU") is made and entered into by and
("CRMC"), whose address is 214 E. 23rd St, Cheyenne, WY 82001, Cheyenne Fire Rescue
("CFR"), whose address is 415 W.18th St, Cheyenne, WY 82001, and American Medical
Response Ambulance Service, Inc.("AMR"), whose address is 2542 Old Happy Jack Rd,
Cheyenne, WY82009.
2.Purpose.
CRMC is a non-profit organization that operates an acute care hospital and provides
healthcare services to persons in Cheyenne, WY and surrounding communities.CRMC has
determined that collaborating with AMR will aid its charitable mission by allowing healthcare
providers to share health information and provide more efficient and effective care, thereby
improving the health of persons within CR MC's service area.
CFR is an all-risk fire department that provides numerous types of services to the
community and its citizens.With an ever-growing community, Cheyenne Firefighters have
become increasingly relied upon, and utilized, formany services.
AMRis an ambulance service that currently operates as the exclusive emergent and non-
Regional Internal Transport Program.
The purpose of this MOU is to establish the terms and conditions under which the parties
will manage mutual care management as it relates tocommunity para medicine and non-emergency
transport.
Notwithstanding anything set forth in this MOU, except for transports performed under the
Regional Internal Transport Program, and/or any other services specifically negotiated between
the parties during the contract period, AMRshallbe the exclusive provider for all ambulance(both
transports performed under this MOU shall bein accordance with the terms set forth in the 2022
Laramie County EMS Contract between Cheyenne/Laramie County Emergency Medical Services
Joint Powers Board and American Medical Response Ambulance Service, Inc.
